        <mxCell id="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-36" edge="1" parent="1" source="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-35" style="endArrow=ERone;html=1;rounded=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;curved=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;startArrow=ERmany;startFill=0;endFill=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" target="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-30" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points" />
            <mxPoint x="510" y="730" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="510" y="610" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-37" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- 1 owner sẽ có nhiều cơ sở (Facility)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- 1 Facility sẽ có nhiều sân con ở trong cơ sở đó (Court)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- 1 Owner sẽ setup nhiều bộ lịch template(bao gồm tên và cấu trúc) (Schedule Template)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp; 1 Schedule Template sẽ được áp dụng cho nhiều sân con bên trong 1 Facility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- 1 Schedule Template sẽ có nhiều từng khung giờ cụ thể trong bộ lịch đó (TemplateSlot)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ScheduleTemplate: &quot;Lịch 1 giờ - 5h00 đến 22h00&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;---------- TemplateSlot: 5h00 - 6h00&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---------- TemplateSlot: 6h00 - 7h00&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---------- TemplateSlot: 7h00 - 8h00&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---------- .....&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---------- TemplateSlot: 21h00 - 22h00&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;và khi ScheduleTemplate được áp dụng cho Court, Court sẽ sử dụng toàn bộ các TemplateSlot bên trong nó.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="430" x="10" y="900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-38" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Owner có thể block được các slot của từng sân nên sinh ra bảng&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;CourtSlotBlock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; Mục đích thể hiện: Block các slot vào của các sân nào&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Owner cũng có thể merge các slot các từng sân lại với nhau nên sinh ra 2 bảng CourtSlotGroup và CourtSlotGroupItem. Bản chất chỉ cần một bảng CourtSlotGroup là đủ, nhưng tách ra cho dễ làm, dễ maintan và dễ scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;CourtSlotGroup: đại diện cho một nhóm slot đã gột của một Court&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;CourtSlotGroupItem: thể hiện từng TemplateSlot thuộc nhóm đó.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&g