        <mxCell id="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-89" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cụm user phân quyền&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="280" x="820" y="-440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Uji5vn4VumvAmUcm73qi-90" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Một user sẽ có thể có 3 role: customer, admin, owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Mội tài khoản được tạo luôn có role là customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Nếu một customer muốn trở thành một owner thì phải tạo đơn (OwnerRequest) và Admin sẽ duyệt đơn đó&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Khi đơn được duyệt thành công thì sinh ra OwnerProfile -&amp;gt; đồng thời bảng OwnerProfile cũng cho ta xác định được là một đó là một owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Mỗi user đều có userProfilee&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
